      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "'durable' happens at t3 (WAL fsync).\n'visible to other txns' happens at t5\n(ProcArray removal). Order matters.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
